        "Where is it relative to the hyoid and the sternocleidomastoid (SCM)? Anterior border of the SCM means a second cleft; the parotid or the EAC means a first cleft; the pyriform apex or thyroid means a third or fourth pouch.",
        "Is it cystic, solid or vascular? Look for fluid-fluid levels, enhancement, flow voids and internal septa.",
